[Cup]
of = Cup of {0}
; These are possible prefixes for drinks that are removed from the raw player input into 294.
; For example, if the player enters "a cup of coffee" the game is able to truncate the prefix and dispense coffee.
; Should be lowercase (the same case as 294's input internally).
of.prefix_1 = cup of
of.prefix_2 = a cup of
; The following two MUST be valid drinks from 294 in this locale without the "Cup Of" prefix
; They CAN be replaced with a region-specific alternative beverage as an "easter egg"
coffee = Coffee
oj = Orange Juice
; Example
;
; [PATH\TO\SOUND\EFFECT]
; italic=true ; All subtitle lines in this section will now have italics unless overwritten by inline settings.
; 0=This text appears as soon as the sound plays.
; 2.3=This text appears 2.3 seconds after the sound first plays.
; 3.3=<voice=classd,bold=true,caption=true>This text appears after 3.3 seconds. It uses the Class D voice color, it's in bold and only appears if closed captioning is enabled.
; 3.8=<italic=false>This line overrides the italic rule written at the beginning, and is displayed normally. All the other lines will still be displayed in italics.
; 4.0=<r=0,g=255,b=0,length=10>This line of text should be green, it remains displayed on screen for at least 10 seconds.
;
; Available settings
; length=(time in seconds) - REQUIRED if the spoken subtitle is longer than 5 seconds, otherwise this subtitle will disappear before the audio is finished.
; voice=(voice name) - Copies settings from a voice definition in voices.ini
; name=(character name) - Specifies the name of the character speaking this subtitle.
; r, g, b=(a number from 0-255) - Specifies the color of this subtitle's text
; bold, italic=(true/false) - Specifies if the font for this subtitle should be bold and/or italic.
; caption=(true/false) - Specifies if this subtitle is a closed caption. Will only appear if closed captioning is enabled.
; minvolume=(a number from 0.0-1.0) - Specifies the minimum volume of the sound effect for this subtitle to appear.
; cooldown=(time in seconds) - Specifies a cooldown for this subtitle. If this sound effect plays again while this cooldown is active, the subtitle will not be added. This is used to prevent repetitive sounds from flooding the screen.

; --- INTRO ---

; --- AGENT ULGRIN --- 

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\BeforeDoorOpen.ogg]
3.7=<voice=ulgrin,length=6>Control, this is Agent Ulgrin. I need a request to open up Cell 3-11.
8.9=<r=128,g=128,b=128>[from radio] Copy that.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\ExitCell.ogg]
1.37=<voice=ulgrin>Hey, they've got some work for you. Do me a favor, and step outta your cell.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\ExitCellRefuse1.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin,length=6>What, are you stupid or something? I said step outta the cell. If you don't step outta the cell, I'm gonna kick your ass.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\ExitCellRefuse2.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin,length=5.5>Look buddy, I don't have all day. I'm trying to be polite about this. If you don't step outta the cell, I'm gonna kick your ass.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\CellGas1.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin,caption=true>*chuckle*
0.6=<voice=ulgrin,length=6.5>You have got to be the dumbest test subject we've ever had! Oh well, shut the doors and open the gas valves.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\CellGas2.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin,length=5.7>Huh. I'm actually kinda disappointed you didn't put up a fight. I was looking forward to punching you in the face.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\Escort1.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin,length=7.5>Just follow me. Oh, and by the way, we're authorized to kill any disobedient test subjects. So, don't try anything stupid.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\Escort2.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin,length=10>Just follow me. Oh, and by the way, we're authorized to, uh, exterminate any disobedient test subjects. So, I'd recommend not doing anything stupid.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\EscortRun.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin,length=4.3>Hey, dumbass! You're going the wrong way! Get the hell over here right now.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\EscortRefuse1.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin>Hurry up! They're waiting for you!

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\EscortRefuse2.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin>Look dude, I already hate my job. Why are you making it more difficult for me?

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\EscortPissedOff1.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin,length=5.5>I ain't in the mood for this shit. I have no problem putting a bullet in your brain if you don't start cooperating.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\EscortPissedOff2.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin,length=5.5>I'm not in the mood for this shit! I have no problem putting a bullet in your head if you don't start cooperating.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\EscortKill1.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin,length=3.8>Alright you know what, fine. Be that way. We'll just get somebody else then.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\EscortKill2.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin>Alright, fine. Be that way. We'll just get somebody else then.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\EscortTerminated.ogg]
3.1=<voice=ulgrin,length=4.5>I'll get rid of the body. You can go and fetch me another one...

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\EscortDone1.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin,length=6.7>[to you] Well, we're here. Just get in there and follow all the instructions and uh... you'll probably be fine.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\EscortDone2.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin>[to you] Well, we're here. I'm still disappointed I didn't get to punch you but... whatever.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\EscortDone3.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin,length=5.5>[to you] Well, we're here. I'm still disappointed I didn't get to punch you in the face but... whatever.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\EscortDone4.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin,length=9.0>[to you] Just get in there and follow all the instructions and uh... you'll probably be fine. Or maybe you won't be. Either way, I don't really care.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\EscortDone5.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin>[to you] Well anyway, let's not waste anymore time. They're waiting for you down in the chamber.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Ulgrin\OhAndByTheWay.ogg]
0=<voice=ulgrin>Oh, and by the way.

[SFX\Room\Intro\WhatThe.ogg]
0=<voice=franklin>Agent, behind you!
1.15=<voice=ulgrin>Oh shit!
1.65=<voice=franklin>Keep your eyes on it!
4.82=<voice=franklin>Alright, I'm going to blink. Just keep on watching it.
7.78=<voice=ulgrin>Alright, got it.

; --- ESCAPE GUARD ---

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\PlayerEscape.ogg]
0=<voice=guard>What the hell? Hey! Stop! He's getting away!

; --- GUARD CONVERSATION ---

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Conversation1a.ogg]
voice=ulgrin
0=[to other guard] So uh... how's it going?
5.3=Well yeah, who do you think I'm talking to? This guy here with the punchable face? Of course I'm talking to you.
15.40=Well, yeah. It's your first day working here.
23.65=Really? Wow. That's weird.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Conversation1b.ogg]
voice=guard
3.2=Uh... are- are you talking to me?
10.33=Oh! I'm just a little surprised. I think this is the first time you've ever spoken to me.
18.95=Uh... actually we've worked together now for about five months.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Conversation2a.ogg]
voice=ulgrin
0=[to other guard] Uh... so you seen any good movies lately?
7.19=Yeah? What kind of books?
12.5=Heh, you're kidding me?
15.93=<length=5.6>Your whole job revolves around horror and science fiction! Except, y'know, it's not actually fiction.
24.73=Yeah look, no offense, but I've already lost interest in what you're talking about.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Conversation2b.ogg]
voice=guard
3.27=Uh, I- I don't really watch movies. I mostly just read books.
9.0=Uh, horror. Science fiction. Anything like that.
14.8=What?
22.5=Well actually, I'm planning on writing a book about my-

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Conversation3a.ogg]
voice=ulgrin
0=[to other guard] Man, I'm hungry. Hey, today's pizza day down at the cafeteria, right?
7.65=<length=8.5>Oh, god damn it. Well, my day's ruined. The only reason I still come here is for the pizza. I don't know what it is about that pizza, but it's delicious.
16.5=<length=5.5>Tuna casserole, on the other hand, is a disgusting abomination and it should be locked up in here with the rest of these freaks.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Conversation3b.ogg]
voice=guard
4.6=Um, a-actually I think it's tuna casserole.
22.93=Uhh... okay?

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Conversation4a.ogg]
voice=ulgrin
0=[to other guard] You don't have a girlfriend, do you?
3.3=<length=5.5>Well, I'm definitely not a mind reader. Otherwise, I'd be locked up in this place. So, yeah, I'd say it's pretty damn obvious.
13.51=Tell her you work at some coffee shop or something.
23.55=Uh, I dunno! Just... tell her it's uh... ketchup.
30.45=Ugh... just forget it.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Conversation4b.ogg]
voice=guard
1.94=Is it that obvious?
9.14=Well, how am I supposed to get a girlfriend anyway when I have this job? I mean I can't tell her about it.
16.2=<length=7.5>Well, what if I accidentally forgot to wash my hands here at work, and I came home and there was blood all over my hands? What would I say to her then?
26.5=Ketchup? Why would I have ketchup on my hands if I worked at a coffee shop?

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Conversation5a.ogg]
voice=ulgrin
0=[to other guard] Uh... so you seen any good movies lately?
5.4=<length=6>Oh, okay. Oh, what about video games? Y'know, that reminds me, somebody should make a video game based on this place.
13.5=Eh, I dunno. I just thought it was kind of a cool idea. 

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Conversation5b.ogg]
voice=guard
3.2=Uhh, I- I don't really watch movies.
11.5=Why would anyone do that?
17.0=Well, I don't play video games either.

; --- SCIENTIST ---

[SFX\Room\Intro\Scientist\Conversation.ogg]
voice=scientist
0=For some reason, he passed by 079's chamber, and now the doors aren't working.
5.27=Well, at least they weren't working when I last passed by.
12.29=Skinner?
15.5=Hm, I don't recall knowing him. Was he ever stationed at this sector?
25.35=Yeah... he picked up a security agent and a junior researcher on the way.
29.60=Kid was taking papers to his supervisor. Shit sucks.
36.30=It shook up Doctor L pretty badly. He hasn't left his office.
40.35=Says he's been hearing things.

[SFX\Room\Storeroom\Escape1.ogg]
0=<voice=scientist>I think the shortest way out is through the south-east wing. Follow me.

[SFX\Room\Storeroom\Escape2.ogg]
0=<voice=scientist2>Did you hear that?
1.9=<voice=scientist2>I hope it wasn't-

; --- BALCONY GUARD ---

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Balcony\Alert1.ogg]
0=<voice=guard,length=7>Hey, scaredy-cat, you better get your ass back to the chamber now. I'm not gonna ask you again.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Balcony\Alert2.ogg]
0=<voice=guard,length=5.5>Did you really think you could just walk outta here without me noticing? Get back to the chamber now.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Balcony\OhSh.ogg]
0=<voice=guard>Oh, shit. Oh shit! Shit!

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Balcony\WTF1.ogg]
0=<voice=guard>What the fuck is happening?

[SFX\Room\Intro\Guard\Balcony\WTF2.ogg]
0=<voice=guard>What the fuck is happening!?

; --- FRANKLIN ---

[SFX\Room\Intro\Scientist\Franklin\EnterChamber.ogg]
0=<voice=franklin>Attention all Class D personnel, please enter the containment chamber.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Scientist\Franklin\Refuse1.ogg]
0=<voice=franklin,length=6>Subject D-9341, enter the containment chamber or you will be terminated!

[SFX\Room\Intro\Scientist\Franklin\Refuse2.ogg]
0=<voice=franklin>This is your last warning, you have five seconds to comply!

[SFX\Room\Intro\Scientist\Franklin\Refuse3.ogg]
0=<voice=franklin,length=6>Subject D-9341 designated for termination. Fire at will!

[SFX\Room\Intro\Scientist\Franklin\Approach173.ogg]
0=<voice=franklin>Please approach SCP-173 for testing.

[SFX\Room\Intro\Scientist\Franklin\Problem.ogg]
0=<voice=franklin,length=10.57>Uhm, there seems to be a problem with the door control system. The doors aren't responding to any of our attempts to close them. So, please maintain direct eye contact with SCP-173

